OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has a Lancashire village had
OL,4,A25 earthquakes in a year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSilverdale is at the centre of a
OL,7,Fgeological mystery.
OL,9,FOver the course of the past 12 months,
OL,10,F25 earthquakes have been recorded in
OL,11,Fthe Lancashire village, the largest of
OL,12,Fwhich - in December - had a 3.2
OL,13,Fmagnitude and was powerful enough to be
OL,14,Ffelt by people living up to 12 miles
OL,15,F(20km) away.
OL,17,FCCTV footage showed cameras shaking,
OL,18,Flights flickering, and sleeping dogs
OL,19,Fjumping out of their baskets.
OL,21,FOther tremors have been felt in the
OL,22,Fvillage this year too.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
